<h1 class="headline">
YS <small><a href="/faq/">(say "wise")</a></small> makes YAML
<span class="headline__fully">fully </span>dynamic
</h1>

<p class="ys-home-lede">
Add code (variables, functions, imports, transformations, interpolations, etc)
to ordinary YAML. It loads as data like YAML or JSON.
</p>

